if(shape==='earrings'||shape==='hoops')piece=`<g transform="rotate(-12 200 205)" filter="url(#${uid}d)">${[130,268].map(x=>shape==='hoops'?`<ellipse cx="${x}" cy="210" rx="44" ry="71" fill="none" stroke="${m}" stroke-width="21"/><circle cx="${x}" cy="136" r="6" fill="${c[4]}"/>`:`<ellipse cx="${x}" cy="149" rx="23" ry="30" fill="none" stroke="${m}" stroke-width="13"/><path d="M${x} 171 C${x-57} 201 ${x-47} 284 ${x+2} 289 C${x+58} 283 ${x+47} 201 ${x} 171Z" fill="${m}"/><path d="M${x-9} 194 C${x-38} 233 ${x-23} 268 ${x-4} 272" fill="none" stroke="${c[2]}" stroke-width="3" opacity=".65"/>`).join('')}</g>`;
if(shape==='necklace')piece=`<g filter="url(#${uid}d)"><path d="M120 55 C56 169 107 276 200 282 C293 276 344 169 280 55" fill="none" stroke="${m}" stroke-width="4"/><ellipse cx="200" cy="282" rx="9" ry="12" fill="none" stroke="${m}" stroke-width="5"/><path d="M200 290 C167 311 176 353 200 355 C227 352 233 315 200 290Z" fill="${m}"/><path d="M193 305 Q179 330 195 344" fill="none" stroke="${c[2]}" stroke-width="2"/></g>`;
